==Tiers==
As you accumulate Trophies with a Brawler, they are promoted to higher Tiers. Each Brawler's Tier reflects their highest individual Trophy count. Once a Tier is reached on a Brawler, the Brawler cannot be demoted to a lower Tier, even if they lose Trophies.
