===Prestige===
Prestige is unlocked for a Brawler at every multiple of 1000 Trophies. When reaching a new Prestige level, it becomes impossible to drop Trophies below the threshold. The total Prestige of all Brawlers combined is shown on a player's profile and in the Leaderboards. Reaching 1, 25, 50, 100, and 200 total Prestige unlocks a new [[Battle Card]]. There is no limit to the number of Prestige levels a Brawler can have, but the highest tier of Trophy gain is reached in Prestige 4.

==Win Streak==
[[File:Win Streak.png|x50px|right]]
For each win starting from 2 consecutive wins with a single Brawler, a streak counter starts where the Brawler receives 1 additional Trophy per win. Higher Win Streak awards more additional Trophies, with 10 Trophies being maximum number you can receive. If you lose, the counter resets to 0, but if you draw, the counter does not reset. Win Streak does not award additional Trophies above 2000 Trophies.

Each Brawler's current Win Streak is tracked in the Brawlers menu if the streak is at least 2 wins. Streaks above 6 are displayed with a yellow flame. The player's highest-ever Win Streak is displayed on their profile with the associated Brawler next to it.

==Underdog==
[[File:Underdog.png|x50px|right]]
The Underdog System allows you to gain more Trophies or lose fewer Trophies after 3v3 matches if the game believes you got an unfair matchup. These matches display a yellow "Underdog" banner on the end screen. The exact conditions of Underdog are based on MMR score and are as such unknown.

If you win an Underdog match, you receive 5 additional Trophies. If you draw, you receive 4 Trophies. If you lose, you lose no Trophies and your Brawler's Win Streak does not reset. You can't be an Underdog in Ranked, Showdown, Duels, or if your Brawler is above 2000 Trophies.

==Leaderboards==
[[File:Leaderboard.png|x90px|right]]
Leaderboards are accessed by tapping the menu button in the top right and selecting "Leaderboards". The 200 players with the most Trophies are ranked globally and locally in a scoreboard, but you are able to view your exact position if you're within the top 1000. There are also Leaderboards for Clubs with the most combined Trophies, players with the highest Trophies for each individual Brawler, and all-time Trophy achievements.

