==Trophy Road==
[[File:Trophy Road.png|x90px|right]]
[[File:Starr park - map.jpg|x120px|thumb|''The Starr Park map displayed when opening the Trophy Road, showcasing all areas inside it.'']]
Rewards can only be earned for reaching certain total Trophy milestones for the first time. These rewards include new [[Events]] to play, [[Coins]], [[Power Points]], [[Credits]], [[Quests]], [[Starr Drops]].

Additionally, reaching enough Trophies rewards the player [[Profile Icons#Trophy Icons|Profile Icon]]s separate from the Trophy Road.

When the Trophy Road reward path is shown, it shows 20 worlds with 3 areas each that are unlocked by reaching their set milestones. Each area is named after one of the map [[environments]] and associated with up to three related Brawlers marketed together as Trios. Later Worlds remain cloudy until they are added in a future update. If the area's map environment has not existed at any point before its associated World was made visible on the Trophy Road, it is shown under construction.

