==History==
*On 06/07/17, the number of Trophies lost when playing Showdown between 20 and 69 Trophies was decreased.
*On 04/09/17, Trophy Seasons were introduced. Brawlers above 500 Trophies would lose 50% of their Trophies above 500 each season. Trophies were no longer capped at 500. The Trophy system was changed so that you only start losing more Trophies than you gain after 400 Trophies (from 200), and more Trophies were awarded from wins in 3v3.
*On 07/12/17, ranks were established based on total Trophies, with rank-up bonuses and season end rewards. Trophy loss below 419 Trophies was decreased.
*On 18/12/17, Brawler Trophies were added to the battle end screen.
*On 22/12/17, matchmaking accuracy in high-Trophy games was increased.
*On 21/05/18, Trophy Leagues based on total Trophies were introduced. 7 Brawlers were added to the Trophy Road. Trophy loss above 420 Trophies was decreased. Player names would be hidden in Showdown above 300 Trophies.
*On 19/06/18, Trophy League tiers and rewards were adjusted.
*On 05/12/18, the amount of Trophies gained above 500 Trophies in Solo Showdown and Duo Showdown was increased. The matchmaking was improved.
*On 06/02/19, different matchmaking pools were added based on players' total Trophies. 'Play Again' would now be unlocked at 150 Trophies. A prevention mechanism for Trophy pushing was added so you couldn't face against the same player twice within 12 hours.
*On 15/04/19, matchmaking for teams was made more difficult.
*On 26/06/19, each lost Trophy would now be converted to 1 Star Point. Seasonal Token rewards for total Trophies were removed. The Trophy system was changed so that you only start losing more Trophies than you gain after 600 Trophies (from 500), and progress after 700 was made more difficult.
*On 02/07/19, the Trophy system was changed so that you only start losing more Trophies than you gain after 800 Trophies (from 600), and more Trophies were awarded for wins.<ref>https://redd.it/c8949f</ref>
*On 29/08/19, Ranks 21-35 were added, and season end rewards were reworked.
*On 17/03/20, the 'Underdog' system was added.
*On 29/04/20, the 'Play Again' feature would now be unlocked at 500 Trophies instead of 150 Trophies.
*On 13/05/20, Ticket rewards in the Trophy Road were changed to Big Boxes.
*On 02/07/20, the Trophy Road was extended from 14500 to 50000 Trophies.
*On 22/10/20, matchmaking in a team was reworked.
*On 15/12/20, Trophy League seasons were lengthened from 2 to 4 weeks. Season end Trophy decay was reworked.
*On 27/01/21, matchmaking at high ranks was adjusted to be more accurate. Trophies could no longer be gained from the Map Maker 'Winner of The Day' mode.
*On 28/01/21, a player's total Trophies would now affect Community Events matchmaking (in addition to Brawler Trophies).
*On 31/03/22, a player's total Trophies would now affect matchmaking in the 500-799 Brawler Trophy Range.
*On 27/04/22, an issue was fixed where Underdog draws would not award a Trophy bonus.
*On 31/08/22, Trophy League seasons were aligned with Brawl Pass seasons.
*On 28/02/23, adjusted matchmaking for team modes. Bot Matches would now be disabled above 600 Trophies (from 500).
*On 25/04/23, Trophy reset was changed to only reset your highest 20 Brawlers, Trophy decay was increased for Brawlers below 1000 and decreased for Brawlers above 1000, the reward was changed from Star Points to Bling and was decreased heavily, and its seasons were shortened from 2 months to 2 weeks. The amount of Credits on the Trophy Road was increased from 1000 to 10000 Trophies, and added milestones with 500 Chroma Credits at 2000 and 4000 Trophies. Underdogs would not lose any Trophies if they lose the match, and the requirement was decreased to 150 Trophies (from 200). Opponents' player names would now be hidden for matches above 1000 Trophies (from 600). The time to face the same player again was decreased from 24 hours to 30 minutes.
*On 23/05/23, Trophy reset was changed to only reset your highest 10 Brawlers (from 20), the number of Trophies lost was decreased, the Bling reward was increased, and its seasons were lengthened from 2 weeks to 4 weeks.
*On 12/12/23, Trophy Road was tweaked to unlock game modes sooner and include Starr Drops as rewards. Win Streak was added.
*On 13/12/23, Win Streak was disabled due to a bug.
*On 18/12/23, Win Streak was re-enabled. Fixed a bug that let players earn a Win Streak while playing Map Maker.
*On 01/02/24, changed matchmaking to allow duplicate Brawlers, removed the blacklisting time, and increased the differences in Trophies.
*On 03/02/24, the changes from 01/02/24 were reverted.
*On 27/02/24, the Trophy Road was extended from 50000 to 70000 Trophies. Ranks were renamed to Tiers.
*On 29/10/24, Tiers were reworked to make 51 tiers, with the highest at 1000 Trophies. Trophy League seasons were aligned with Brawl Pass seasons. Brawlers above 1000 Trophies would lose all of their Trophies above 1000 each season. Trophy Reset no longer awarded Bling, instead, every Trophy above 1000 went towards upgrading the Trophy Box. Matchmaking would no longer consider total Trophies. After 1000 Trophies, players would all be in the same matchmaking pool. The Trophy system was changed so that you only start losing more Trophies than you gain after 1100 Trophies (from 800). Underdog was removed after 1000 Trophies, and the requirement was decreased to 100 Trophies (from 150). Win Streak was tied to individual Brawlers. The highest Win Streak record in profiles was now displayed with your previously selected favorite Brawler. The all-time Leaderboard was added. Reaching new tiers no longer awarded XP and Bling. Bot Matches would now be disabled above 800 Trophies (from 600). Prestige was added.
*On 31/10/24, fixed a bug that let players earn a Win Streak while playing Ranked. Fixed all-time Leaderboard showing inaccurate data.
*On 24/06/25, the Trophy Road was extended from 70000 to 100000 Trophies, and all of its rewards were redone. Rare and Super Rare Brawlers were made exclusive to the Trophy Road.
*On 03/09/25, new tiers were added at 1200, 1500, 2000, and 3000 Trophies. The appearance of all tiers were changed and now appear on the [[Credits#Battle Cards|Battle Card]] in place of [[Records|Record Level]]. The matchmaking was adjusted above 1000 Trophies so players are more consistently matched with other players of similar Trophy count. The amount of Trophies lost in [[Brawl Arena]] was increased by 50% (rounds down). World 3 in Trophy Road was added.
*On 28/10/25, the matchmaking was adjusted. World 4 in Trophy Road was added.
*On 16/12/25, World 5 in Trophy Road was added, and rewards across the entire track were increased.
*On 25/02/26, the Trophy Season, Trophy reset, Trophy Boxes, Season Trophies and Prestige were removed. Tiers were reworked with only 4 tiers before 1000 Trophies (from 500). Trophy Roads were added for individual Brawlers. Prestige was added, which would lock a Brawler's Trophies at every multiple of 1000 Trophies. Prestige Battle Cards, Prestige Icons, and Prestige Titles were added. The Trophy system was changed so that you only start losing more Trophies than you gain after 2000 Trophies (from 1100), and more Trophies were awarded for wins. Win Streak could now award up to 10 Trophies (from 5), but no Trophies above 2000. Underdog would now be disabled above 2000 Trophies (from 1000), Trophies on wins were increased to 5 (from 4), and 3 Trophies fewer would be lost on losses (from none). Player names would now be hidden above 2000 Trophies (from 1000). Bot Matches would now be disabled above 2000 Trophies (from 800). A hidden MMR was added for matchmaking which declared the skill level of a player. World 6 in Trophy Road was added.
*On 04/03/26, fixed a bug where a Brawler's Trophy count could drop below the Trophy gate after losing a [[Duels]] match. Fixed a bug where losing Free Play matches resulted in Bot Matches in other slots.
*On 22/04/26, Battle Cards for 100 and 200 Prestige were added. Reporting was added to Trophy games. World 7 in Trophy Road was added.
*On 30/06/26, no Trophies would be lost on losing Underdog matches (from 3 fewer). Reaching a new Prestige now gets announced in club chat. World 8 in Trophy Road was added.
*On 01/09/26, Rare and Super Rare Brawlers were moved out of the Trophy Road and were replaced by equivalent Credits. World 9 in Trophy Road was added.
*On 07/10/26, Trophy loss was increased at 2000-2799 Trophies in [[Hide & Seek]]:<br>2000-2499 ⸺ 3rd: -1➞-3 ⸺ 4th: -10➞-11<br>2500-2799 ⸺ 3rd: -2➞-4 ⸺ 4th: -11➞-12
*On 03/11/26, World 10 in Trophy Road was added. The Creepsville World was moved 2 spots earlier.

